  <h1>Home Loans</h1>
  <section id="apply" class="container">
    <h2>Discover the Perfect Home Loans for Your Lifestyle</h2>
    <p>At RupeeXpert, we believe that owning your dream home is a significant milestone, and we're here to help make it a reality. Whether you're buying your first home, upgrading to a larger space, or refinancing your current mortgage, our home loan solutions offer competitive rates and flexible terms to suit your needs.</p>
</section>
  <section id="selection" class="container">
    <h2>Why Choose a Home Loan through RupeeXpert?</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Wide Range of Options:</strong>We partner with top banks and financial institutions to provide you with a variety of home loan options. This ensures you find the perfect loan that fits your budget and home-buying goals.</li>
        <li><strong>Competitive Interest Rates:</strong>Enjoy some of the lowest interest rates available, making your home loan more affordable and manageable.</li>
        <li><strong>Flexible Terms:</strong>Choose from various loan terms that suit your financial situation. Whether you need a short-term or long-term loan, we have options that align with your plans.</li>
        <li><strong>Simple Application Process:</strong>Our user-friendly application process makes it easy to apply for a home loan. Complete your application quickly and efficiently online.</li>
        <li><strong>Fast Approval and Disbursement:</strong>We understand that timing is crucial in the home-buying process. Our efficient approval and disbursement process ensures you get the funds you need without unnecessary delays.</li>
    </ul>
</section>

<section id="benefits" class="container">
    <h2>Benefits of Our Home Loans</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Affordable Financing: </strong>With our competitive rates and flexible terms, you can finance your dream home without stretching your budget. We offer solutions that make homeownership more accessible.</li>
        <li><strong>Easy Access to Funds:</strong>Once approved, the loan amount will be disbursed directly to you or your property seller, streamlining the home-buying process.</li>
        <li><strong>Tailored Solutions:</strong>Our range of home loan options means you can find a loan that matches your specific needs, whether you’re buying a new home or refinancing an existing mortgage.</li>
        <li><strong>No Hidden Costs:</strong>We pride ourselves on transparency. Our home loans come with clear terms and no hidden fees, so you know exactly what to expect.</li>
        <li><strong>Expert Guidance:</strong>Our team is here to help you throughout the loan process, from application to approval. We provide expert advice to ensure you make the best financial decisions.</li>
    </ul>
</section>



<section id="apply" class="container">
    <h2>How It Works</h2>
    <ol>
        <li><strong>Explore Options:</strong>Review our selection of home loan offers from leading banks. Compare features, benefits, and rates to find the best fit for your needs.</li>
        <li><strong>Check Eligibility:</strong>Use our eligibility tool to see which home loan options you qualify for. This helps you narrow down your choices and find the best offers.</li>
        <li><strong>Apply Online:</strong>Complete a secure online application with your personal and financial details. Our process is designed to be straightforward and efficient.</li>
        <li><strong>Get Approved:</strong>After reviewing your application, we’ll provide a decision quickly. Once approved, the funds will be disbursed to help you purchase or refinance your home.</li>
        <li><strong>Enjoy Your New Home:</strong>With your home loan in place, you can proceed with buying your new home or refinancing your current mortgage.</li>
    </ol>
</section>

<section id="faq" class="container">
    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)</h2>
    <div class="faq-section">
        <div class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-question">What documents do I need to apply for a home loan?</div>
            <div class="faq-answer">You will generally need to provide documents such as proof of identity (like a passport or driver’s license), proof of address (like a utility bill), proof of income (such as salary slips or bank statements), and property documents (if applicable).</div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-question">How long does it take to get approved for a home loan?</div>
            <div class="faq-answer">Approval times vary, but typically, it takes a few days to a couple of weeks. We work to ensure a quick and smooth process to help you secure your home loan as efficiently as possible.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-question">Can I apply for a home loan if I have bad credit?</div>
            <div class="faq-answer">It may be more challenging to get approved with poor credit, but it’s not impossible. Consider improving your credit score or discussing options with us to find a suitable loan.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-question">How much can I borrow for a home loan?</div>
            <div class="faq-answer">The amount you can borrow depends on various factors, including your income, credit score, and the value of the property. Use our eligibility checker to get an estimate of how much you can borrow.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-question">What should I do if my home loan application is denied?</div>
            <div class="faq-answer">If your application is denied, review the feedback provided and work on improving your financial situation. You may also consider reapplying or exploring other loan options that better match your profile.</div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
<script>
  document.querySelectorAll('.faq-question').forEach(question => {
      question.addEventListener('click', () => {
          const answer = question.nextElementSibling;
          question.classList.toggle('active');
          answer.classList.toggle('show');
      });
  });
</script>
         
